AC -35 is fine, IMO. As for the magic marker, do you have enough ?gold
detection? do you have cursed ?teleport ? useful for:
- bottom of wizard tower -> top of wizard tower
- top of wizard tower -> vibrating square
- vibrating square->left side of sanctum (bypassing horde of monsters)

As far as weapons go, remember if you #twoweapon, then your "skill"
rating for both weapons is the lowest of (#twoweapon skill | weapon 1
skill | weapon 2 skill) - it takes the least common denominator. I'd
be using +6 stormbringer and +5 long sword swapping out maybe the
silver saber when you see a demon. Also, the silver saber doesn't need
to be fooproofed as silver doesn't corrode/rot/etc. Ranged weapons are
nice for finishing off a rider from a distance, because as you know
you don't want to stand next to them for longer than you have to.

